        }
      ],
      "message": "test: Check that bdbro rejects an empty overflow page\n\nWrite a small BDB file by hand whose only overflow page has no data\nand links to itself, and check that bitcoin-wallet dump fails instead\nof looping. A second file with a filled overflow page is dumped as\nbefore.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jan Kahmen <jan@turingpoint.de>",
